      "title": "The standard way",
      "body": "Use Tôi có đặt chỗ as your first sentence for \"I have a booking\". This is for when the booking exists and you need staff to find it first. Leave a short pause after the phrase so the other person can answer with a name check, booking-code request, counter direction, or short wait. Keep the booking, ticket, room number, or time visible when the exact detail matters.",
