      "body": "Time phrases prevent missed pickups, bookings, and closing times. For \"I have a booking\", Tôi có đặt chỗ helps by putting the booking first so staff can look it up before you explain more. Keep the booking name, code, room number, or ticket visible until staff find the record.",
